flowchart TB
    subgraph launch["Contextual launch"]
        E[Explorer double-click] --> P[pythonw md-view.py file]
    end

    P --> C{classify by extension}
    C -->|.md .markdown| M[Python-Markdown<br/>+ mermaid fences]
    C -->|.mmd .mermaid| D[single mermaid diagram]
    C -->|.svg| S[vector image canvas]
    C -->|.png .jpg .gif ...| R[raster image canvas]
    C -->|.txt .json ...| T[verbatim text]

    M --> H[HTML page in temp dir]
    D --> H
    S --> H
    R --> H
    T --> H

    H --> W[["WebView2 window"]]
    W --> Z[/"zoom: Ctrl +/- , wheel, fit"/]
    W --> F[/"watch mtime, auto-reload"/]
